2026-07-27T10:29:49.6594111Z i /tmp/RtmpdTsrYh/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:29:49.6594459Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:29:49.6595151Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:29:49.6595571Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:29:49.6596114Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:29:49.6596909Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:29:49.6597619Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
